{
  "bookId": "hero-212012",
  "id": "bond-28542",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28542001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "开始吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我先来，我总是一个人……打游戏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "一个人晨跑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯……我总是一个人，做手办涂装。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "一个人执行任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "凛的反应太快了，完全不给我留反应时间嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我要再想想，我总是一个人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "让你感到为难了吗？中止也可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不！我想到了，我总是一个人……跟凛在一起！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "这不好笑。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为看到凛总是一个人啊，不论做什么都是一个人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一个人的滋味……很不好受吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "没有负担、变故、麻烦、拖累。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "没有埋怨、分歧、争吵、伤害。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "很干净。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是一个人的话，也不会有倾诉、陪伴、信任和爱呀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "陪伴，爱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28542019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "它们都是……太过奢侈的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
